# 2. PROJECT VISION

Build a sophisticated, visually impressive, modular AI video production application that allows users to transform photographs, collections of images, written descriptions, music, and lyrics into professionally organized cinematic music videos.

The application must provide an intuitive creative workspace while using ComfyUI as its underlying AI generation infrastructure.

The application is inspired by the flexibility of ComfyUI, but its primary interface must be a new, purpose-designed creative studio.

The ordinary user should not need to understand complicated node graphs, Python scripts, CUDA, model loading, or GPU memory management.

The application should intelligently organize the entire production process.

The user should be able to:

1. Create a video production project.
2. Upload individual images or ZIP archives containing images.
3. Analyze the uploaded images using vision-language models.
4. Identify recurring characters and preserve their visual identities.
5. Generate structured character descriptions and Character Bibles.
6. Organize images into scenes.
7. Generate cinematic scene descriptions.
8. Create positive and negative prompts.
9. Configure video-generation models.
10. Generate video clips through ComfyUI.
11. Review, compare, and regenerate clips.
12. Import music and lyrics.
13. Synchronize video scenes with music and lyrics.
14. Assemble a complete video.
15. Preview the finished production.
16. Export the final MP4 and complete project.
17. Reopen an existing project and continue production.

The application must be modular and extensible.

Do not hard-code the entire system around a single video-generation model.

